[2026-01-30T16:49:54.529Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Execute this requirement immediately without asking questions.\n\n## REQUIREMENT\n\n# Shell As Composable Layout Protocol\n\n## Metadata\n- **Category**: maintenance\n- **Effort**: Unknown (N/A/3)\n- **Impact**: Unknown (N/A/3)\n- **Scan Type**: insight_synth\n- **Generated**: 1/30/2026, 1:20:46 AM\n\n## Description\nReportShell, ReportModal, and ReportView form a layered containment hierarchy (modal->shell->view) that could be generalized. Create a LayoutProtocol abstraction where any content can declare its shell requirements (backdrop, animations, keyboard handlers) and compose them declaratively rather than through nesting.\n\n## Reasoning\nThe current architecture embeds layout decisions in component hierarchy. A protocol-based approach would allow the same view to be rendered in a modal, drawer, or full-page context without code changes. This inverts control from container to content.\n\n## Context\n\n**Note**: This section provides supporting architectural documentation and is NOT a hard requirement. Use it as guidance to understand existing code structure and maintain consistency.\n\n### Context: Report Shell & Navigation\n\n**Description**: Main report container with themed sidebar, toolbar, and navigation. Provides the structural layout and controls for viewing research reports.\n**Related Files**:\n- `src/components/report/ReportShell.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/ReportView.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/ReportSidebar.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/ThemedSidebar.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/ReportToolbar.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/index.tsx`\n- `src/components/layout/ReportModal.tsx`\n\n**Post-Implementation**: After completing this requirement, evaluate if the context description or file paths need updates. Use the appropriate API/DB query to update the context if architectural changes were made.\n\n## Recommended Skills\n\n- **compact-ui-design**: Use `.claude/skills/compact-ui-design.md` for high-quality UI design references and patterns\n\n## Notes\n\nThis requirement was generated from an AI-evaluated project idea. No specific goal is associated with this idea.\n\n## AFTER IMPLEMENTATION\n\n1. Log your implementation using the `log_implementation` MCP tool with:\n   - requirementName: the requirement filename (without .md)\n   - title: 2-6 word summary\n   - overview: 1-2 paragraphs describing what was done\n\n2. Check for test scenario using `check_test_scenario` MCP tool\n   - If hasScenario is true, call `capture_screenshot` tool\n   - If hasScenario is false, skip screenshot\n\n3. Verify: `npx tsc --noEmit` (fix any type errors)\n\nBegin implementation now."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bb700aba-f9fc-4283-93cf-561e37220b63","uuid":"805ace80-5de2-47e8-90de-2ff3bd482e2e","isSynthetic":true}
